# ─── RTXCoreOrchestrate .gitignore ────────────────────────────────────────────
# Runtime junk: workspaces, session state, health reports, scratchpads.
# (Historical junk stays committed — this only blocks future noise.)

# Per-run session workspaces & state
**/workspaces/
**/*.state.json
**/health-report.json
**/fugu_scratchpads/

# Dependencies & OS clutter
node_modules/
.DS_Store
*.log

# Editors
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
